				<wikidot:authorName>Amelia Wright</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3754950</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Alright, so I gotta say, there's huge improvement here. To be honest I fully admit I didn't like your previous work, as I felt it overally too similar to fanfiction, with famous SCP characters shoehorned in without any real purpose, MD they didn't feel like actual characters, and the first person writing style through me off, it just felt very stilted and uncomfortable and not in a good way.</p> <p>But I like this a lot. I think it flows together well, the original character is interesting, and I like how you've built a story around notes and qoutations. Take a plus one, especially for great improvement.</p> 
				 	]]>
