					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13578025#post-4727859</guid>
				<title>Author Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13578025/hurt#post-4727859</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2020 03:35:51 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>KaraKatt</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5950867</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OvoTktdpIiI">I wear this crown of shit.</a></em></strong><br /> <strong><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OvoTktdpIiI">Upon my liar's chair.</a></em></strong><br /> <strong><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OvoTktdpIiI">Full of broken thoughts, I cannot repair.</a></em></strong><br /> <strong><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OvoTktdpIiI">Beneath the stains of time, The feelings disappear.</a></em></strong></p> </div> </blockquote> <p>Alright, so, this was an interesting tale to write. It hit incredibly close to home for me, so, I guess take that how you will. I drew a bit from past experiences.</p> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">This may have been the quickest I have posted a tale from conception to posting. It took about 6 days, so a new record for me, lol.</span> Nope. Check out <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/without-you">Without You</a> the newest tale. under 24 hours from writing to posting.</p> <p>Anyway, I would like to thank my critters: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/voidlady" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5366711&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1595710623" alt="VoidLady" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5366711)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/voidlady" >VoidLady</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/flopmind" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6407594&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1595710623" alt="Flopmind" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6407594)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/flopmind" >Flopmind</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3009022&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1595710623" alt="not_a_seagull" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3009022)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" >not_a_seagull</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/redredred" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5379342&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1595710623" alt="redredred" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5379342)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/redredred" >redredred</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/comrade-waldo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6123043&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1595710623" alt="Comrade Waldo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6123043)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/comrade-waldo" >Comrade Waldo</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jimthevettech" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5478148&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1595710623" alt="Jimthevettech" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5478148)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jimthevettech" >Jimthevettech</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hexick" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5065702&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1595710623" alt="Hexick" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5065702)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hexick" >Hexick</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/marcelles-raynes" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5722579&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1595710623" alt="Marcelles_Raynes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5722579)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/marcelles-raynes" >Marcelles_Raynes</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nagiros" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4665703&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1595710623" alt="Nagiros" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4665703)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nagiros" >Nagiros</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harryblank" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6479803&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1595710623" alt="HarryBlank" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6479803)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harryblank" >HarryBlank</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiifu" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6394107&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1595710623" alt="chiifu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6394107)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiifu" >chiifu</a></span> for their reading and critiquing (duh) of this deeply depressing tale.</p> <p>Then of course, a thank you to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/voidlady" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5366711&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1595710623" alt="VoidLady" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5366711)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/voidlady" >VoidLady</a></span> for creating Kassidy as a character. To think this was all based off of some dumb shit I said in a discord server back before my birthday. I love her tons and I am very happy she did the work on the original.</p> <p>Thank you so much for reading, and have a wonderful day!</p> 
				 	]]>
